          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Either through unfortunate circumstances or your own choice, you remain a Hellknight armiger instead of entering the true ranks of your order, though you still believe in the tenets of law and order. You likely take on an adventuring life with a group of like-minded individuals who aren't Hellknights. The resistance to mental damage you gained from the Hellknight Dedication feat increases to 5 + your number of archetype class feats from the Hellknight archetype.</p>\n<p>You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Warding Shift] action, which allows you to keep your allies from harm.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> You can't take both this feat and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Hellknight Preferment] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Hellknight Signifer Preferment].</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Hellknight Dedication"
              },
              {
                "value": "you’ve refused to take or have failed the Hellknight Test"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Hellfire Dispatches"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
